From 2805c6459a4b139310a4358db956ad6654589266 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 19:04:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Convert to mapless, GPS-denied point-to-point navigation

- Remove SLAM/prior-map stack (slam_toolbox, map_server, maps)
- Remove all global planning (A* package, Nav2 planner config, planner comparison tools)
- Rewrite pure pursuit as point-chasing (goal from /goal_pose, odom frame)
- RViz: fixed frame odom, drop /map and /path displays
- Add README with new project description

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KtcRkfw1W3hqMkuqb5VFF2
